  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Is this SEO course really free?",
      "a": "<p>Yes. Every lesson is a public guide on our blog, with no sign-up and no fee.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Who is this course for?",
      "a": "<p>It suits owners, marketers and new team members at small and mid-sized firms. You do not need any tech skills to start.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does the course take?",
      "a": "<p>Each lesson takes about an hour to read and try. So at one lesson a day, you finish in a week.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Do I get a certificate?",
      "a": "<p>No. The course is a set of guides, not a paid program. Instead, you get a site that is in better shape after each lesson.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I do after the course?",
      "a": "<p>Run a <a href=\"/report/\">free SEO audit</a> on your site. It shows which fixes will make the biggest difference next.</p>"
    }
